<title>USA: Homestead Village names Cryan co-chairman.</title>
<headline>Homestead Village names Cryan co-chairman.</headline>
<dateline>ATLANTA 1996-12-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Homestead Village Inc said Wednesday that Michael Cryan has joined as co-chairman and chief operating officer.</p>
<p>Cryan was most recently executive vice president and chief financial officer of ITT Sheraton, a business unit of ITT Corp, the company said.</p>
</text>
